# Populi / AI Models / Data
populi/runs/
populi/data/*.jsonl
.vox-research-data/
.vox/cache/
.vox/artifacts/
**/.vox/cache/
**/.vox/artifacts/
# Telemetry upload spool — runtime state written by vox-telemetry's
# upload queue; pending/ holds per-event JSON until upload succeeds.
# Not source-of-truth, regenerated on every run, should not be committed.
.vox/telemetry-upload-queue/
# Nested form, matching the **/ anchoring used for cache/ and artifacts/ above.
# Belt and braces only: a nested .vox is a BUG (see paths::repo_dot_vox_dir),
# and ignoring it must not become the way we stop noticing.
**/.vox/telemetry-upload-queue/
# Runtime memory stubs (regenerated locally; never commit)
/.vox/memory/
# Per-branch policy run-status overlay (Phase 1c): machine-specific, written by
# `vox ci`/code-audit/arch gates per branch. Regenerated on every run; never commit.
.vox/policy-status/
# Antigravity delegation worktrees (ephemeral, per-delegation)
/.vox/agy-worktrees/
**/.vox/policy-status/
